Important:
- POST /api/checkout should be the main buyer-facing order-creation flow.
- Do not also add POST /api/orders unless there is a distinct, justified order-creation use case.
- Recalculate price, discounts, shipping, and stock on the server; never trust client totals.
- Reserve stock atomically with an expiry. Release reservations on timeout/cancellation/failure.
- Use an idempotency key for checkout/payment initiation to reduce duplicate orders.

